A new way to collaborate outside Simul=C2=A0

One of the things we've learned about Simul users over hundreds of conversa=
tions is that not everybody they collaborate with actually has a Simul acco=
unt.

=C2=A0

It's always been possible to work with people outside of Simul and get thei=
r changes back into your version history, but it wasn't a great user experi=
ence. There were too many steps in the process and there were a number of w=
ays we could make it better.

=C2=A0

So we built a new feature called 'Share This Version' which makes it easier=
 and more secure to collaborate with people who don't have Simul accounts.

=C2=A0

To learn more about this new feature and how to use it, check out the launc=
h article.

LEARN THE NEW FEATURE ( https://www.simuldocs.com/announcements/share-this-=
version )

=C2=A0

=C2=A0

Easily collaborate on Microsoft Word documents

Level 13, 333 George Street, Sydney NSW 2000

